<p><em>Unless otherwise stated, any graphics or images in my articles are made and/or taken by me.</em></p>
<p>The first draft of this was from July 2016; I got the idea when I was working retail and thought &quot;hey, how come we with boring jobs never get any weird events when all the physicists are discovering wormholes and aliens and whatnot?&quot; I then had a revision that I didn't like, gave up on it again for a month, and then finally reinvigorated it a third time and tied it all together a few days ago. My thanks to<br />
